Package: eduka-update-system
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1, libfontconfig1, libfreetype6, libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libxcursor1, libxi6, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libwayland-client0, libnotify-bin, pkexec | policykit-1, gnupg, apt, systemd | systemd-sysv
Recommends: fonts-dejavu-core | fonts-noto-core, lxqt-policykit | polkit-kde-agent-1 | mate-polkit | policykit-1-gnome, needrestart, flatpak, desktop-file-utils, hicolor-icon-theme
Homepage: https://www.edukasaunos.tl/
Description: graphical update, kernel and repository-key manager for Edukasaun OS
 Eduka-Update-System (EUS) presents APT and Flatpak updates grouped by risk,
 installs them through PolicyKit, and integrates with the Eduka-Panel.
 Its programs are written in Rust; the interface uses Slint.
 .
 It also installs and removes kernels (old kernels are marked after a
 restart and can be removed safely), repairs missing or expired APT GPG
 keys and damaged keyrings, adds GPG keys and repositories manually, fixes
 duplicate repository entries, refreshes automatically when a repository is
 added in a terminal, and lets the user schedule or pause update checks.
